#[navbar]

#[section, $md:
    @../../../ (Documentation) / @../ (Core packages) / Core time

    # Core time

    `@core/time` separates monotonic elapsed time from UTC wall-clock time. Many
    APIs blur these domains, which makes duration measurements vulnerable to
    clock changes. Moth gives each domain an opaque type.
]

